SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 0 - Foundation
DESCRIPTION:Monorepo, Spring Boot, MariaDB, Liquibase, jOOQ, Protobuf, Docker Compose, CI and authentication skeleton.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:exochat-phase1-20270101@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20261123T071600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270301
SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 1 - Domain and messaging backend
DESCRIPTION:Identity, communities, permissions, conversations, message persistence, transactional outbox and RabbitMQ.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:exochat-phase2-20270301@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20261123T071600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270401
SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 2 - Realtime web alpha
DESCRIPTION:React client, WebSocket delivery, presence, typing and reconnect synchronization.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:exochat-phase3-20270401@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20261123T071600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270401
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270501
SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 3 - Private beta hardening
DESCRIPTION:Moderation, attachments, rate limits, load tests, backups and security review.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:exochat-phase4-20270501@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20261123T071600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270701
SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 4 - Extension foundations
DESCRIPTION:Manifests, permissions, event catalogue, first-party extensions and SDK prototype.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:exochat-phase5-20270701@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20261123T071600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270701
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270901
SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 5 - Activities and developer preview
DESCRIPTION:Activity lifecycle, widgets, extension storage and developer documentation.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:exochat-phase6-20270901@example.invalid
DTSTAMP:20261123T071600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271201
SUMMARY:ExoChat Phase 6 - Public beta and desktop
DESCRIPTION:Desktop packaging, performance work, onboarding, public developer preview and conditional voice prototype.
